From: pucawo <github@pucawo.de>
Date: Wed, 6 May 2026 23:45:01 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/9] feat(files): pipeline emit-hooks + chip CSS for Phase 2
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Stage 3 of Phase 2:

- inlinePipeline / ragPipeline: emit a 'status' event next to every
  pathStatus write (loaded / failed / embedded / failed). Minimal-
  invasive next to the existing safeUpdateFile call rather than a
  refactor — keeps the Phase 3 write semantics intact.
- processCodeOutput: emit 'session_file' after registerSessionFile
  *successfully matches* a conversation. Matched=0 (cross-user
  injection silently rejected) and DB throws both skip the emit so
  the bus never carries something the DB doesn't reflect.
- style.css: .file-status-chip + .chip-success/.chip-warn/.chip-error/
  .chip-pending using LibreChat's --green/--amber/--red ramp + .dark
  overrides. Same vars Light/Dark/Neon all consume, so the chip
  inherits the theme cleanly.

Tests: sse-bus.test.js — 9 cases covering happy, failure, skip-route
and cross-user-injection paths.

Phase 2 Tasks 6 + 7.
